+▶ arith_loop: 32-variable arithmetic loop / register pressure
+▶ fib: recursive Fibonacci / recurrence recognition
+▶ matmul: dense matrix multiply / FP and cache
+▶ qsort: quicksort via libc / branches
+▶ sieve: sieve of Eratosthenes / stores
+▶ tce_sum: tail-recursive accumulator / TCE
+▶ nbody: N-body simulation / FP structs
+▶ binary_trees: binary trees / allocation and recursion
+▶ spectral_norm: spectral norm / dense floating point
+▶ mandelbrot: Mandelbrot / FP branch-heavy inner loop
+▶ hash_table: hash table / pointer chasing
+▶ strlen_bench: string operations / byte loops
+▶ switch_dispatch: switch lowering / dispatch
+▶ struct_copy: struct copy / ABI and memory
+▶ loop_patterns: scalar loop transforms
+▶ fannkuch: Fannkuch-Redux / permutations
+▶ ackermann: Ackermann / deep recursion
+▶ constant_recursion: constant recursive specialization
+▶ bitops: bit manipulation / integer selection
+▶ double_reduction: two independent accumulators per loop (multi-reduction)
+▶ ascii_case_fold: ASCII parser case-fold byte loop / branch selection
+▶ binary_search: sorted-table binary search / branch-heavy lookup
+▶ ring_fifo: masked ring FIFO enqueue/dequeue / dependent loads
+▶ aarch64_select_patterns: conditional increment, narrow compare, and select pressure
+▶ histogram: 256-bin histogram / indexed increment and reduction
+▶ gzip_crc32: GNU gzip CRC-32 scalar table loop
+▶ libm_round_family: glibc libm scalar rounding entry points (vroundsd inline)
+▶ tls_seg_access: glibc TLS access shapes (THREAD_SELF/SETMEM, %fs segment)
+▶ zlib_ng_adler32: zlib-ng Adler-32 NMAX accumulator
+▶ expat_xml_scan: Expat UTF-8 XML name-token scan
+▶ sqlite_varint: SQLite 1–9 byte varint decoder
+▶ linux_find_bit: Linux sparse find_next_andnot_bit
+▶ glibc_memcmp: glibc aligned-word memcmp path
+▶ chacha20_block: ChaCha20 20-round ARX block cipher / register pressure
+▶ sha256_transform: SHA-256 64-step block transform / rotate and schedule
+▶ linux_rbtree: Linux kernel intrusive Red-Black tree insertion and search
+▶ zstd_count: Zstandard fast unaligned match counting (ZSTD_count / ctz)
+▶ lz4_compress: LZ4 fast block compression / 4-byte hash matching
+▶ glibc_strstr: glibc two-way string search / needle shift table
